{
  "slug": "sitemd",
  "name": "Sitemd",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Static site generator / website building toolkit for AI coding agents like Claude Code. It runs on markdown files. (Good for agents, good for humans). It has skills, MCP/CLI, and a live markdown panel for your browser. It has tools for SEO + AI visibility. It lets you host your site anywhere — no subscription, no lock-in.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **14 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (14): `clone` (Clone an existing website into a sitemd project), `deploy` (Deploy the site to its configured hosting target), `feedback` (Submit a bug report, feature request, or question about sitemd), `import` (Import a raw markdown file into the sitemd site as a properly formatted page), `kickstart` (Generate a complete first-draft site from a single prompt), `launch` (Launch the sitemd dev server), `og-image` (Generate a custom branded OG social share image from the site's theme colors and content), `release` (Stage changelog entries and doc updates between releases, then publish them atomically), and 6 more\n- **MCP servers** (1): `sitemd`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install sitemd@claude-community` from `sitemd-cc/sitemd`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 14,
    "mcp": 1
  },
  "sourceType": "community",
